WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.801
This step is preparation before a storm.

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.342
Make a household plan.

00:00:04.342 --> 00:00:07.564
Identify extra help now if anyone may need it.

00:00:07.564 --> 00:00:10.155
Have more than one way to get alerts.

00:00:10.155 --> 00:00:12.396
Follow local emergency managers.

00:00:12.396 --> 00:00:15.408
This app will not warn you in a real storm.
